<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #333;
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 20px;
      }
      .header {
        background: #f8f9fa;
        padding: 20px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .logo {
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        color: #1e40af;
      }
      .content {
        background: white;
        padding: 30px;
        border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        border-radius: 8px;
      }
      h1 {
        font-size: 24px;
        margin-top: 0;
        color: #1f2937;
      }
      .info-box {
        background: #fef3c7;
        border: 1px solid #fbbf24;
        padding: 15px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        margin: 20px 0;
      }
      .footer {
        margin-top: 30px;
        padding-top: 20px;
        border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #6b7280;
        text-align: center;
      }
      ul {
        margin: 15px 0;
        padding-left: 20px;
      }
      li {
        margin: 8px 0;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="header">
      <div class="logo">transferchat.ai</div>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
      <h1>Account Deletion Confirmed</h1>
      
      <p>This email confirms that your RailsRocket account (<%= @email %>) and all associated data have been permanently deleted as per your request.</p>

      <div class="info-box">
        <strong>What was deleted:</strong>
        <ul>
          <li>Your account and profile information</li>
          <li>All connections (SFTP, S3, Google Drive)</li>
          <li>All file transfer history and activity logs</li>
          <li>All authentication sessions</li>
          <li>All OAuth access tokens and integrations</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <p>This action is permanent and cannot be undone. If you created this account using an OAuth provider (Google, GitHub, or Apple), you may need to revoke RailsRocket's access from your OAuth provider's settings.</p>

      <p>If you believe this deletion was performed in error or you did not request it, please contact us immediately at <a href="mailto:support@transferchat.ai">support@transferchat.ai</a>.</p>

      <p>Thank you for using RailsRocket.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>This is an automated confirmation email. Please do not reply.</p>
      <p>&copy; <%= Time.current.year %> RailsRocket</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
